# the graveyard, from which it cannot be cast on Bot2's turn (a creature spell, CR 307.1). On turn 3 it is cast from the
# graveyard and enters with a finality counter; Bot2's second Bolt on turn 4 kills it and it is exiled instead of dying
# (CR 122.1g), leaving the graveyard empty.

